# MedElite Environment Variables

## AI (Gemini yoki OpenAI)

Local development uchun `.env.local` yarating:

```
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
# yoki
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here
```

Production (Vercel) uchun `GEMINI_API_KEY` yoki `OPENAI_API_KEY` ni environment variables ga qo'shing.

Kalit olish:
- Gemini: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
- OpenAI: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys

**Eslatma:** `VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY` faqat local test uchun — production da server-side kalit ishlating.

## Firebase

Firebase config: `src/lib/firebase.ts`
